msgctxt "ControlsView"
msgid "Steam Input: assign L4 to ↑, L5 to ↓, R4 to ← and R5 to →. In communications, ↑/↓ choose, → sends and ← closes. L3/R3 are stick clicks. Y answers Yes; View is Escape outside flight."
